{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "お疲れ様です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46、4期生の林瑠奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobmfrkOx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2月のライブから皆さんと直接お会いできるイベントが続いていましたね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも沢山の愛をありがとうございます☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/moboGczTH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobWBVA3u.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobG7fkSr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobVfC3WJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月も半ば"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いまいち気が入らなくて、心と身体の両面に負荷がかかっている頃かと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんが、どうか自分を労って、無理ない範囲で頑張っていられたら、それ以上ないことです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつだって健康と幸せを願っています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "バースデーライブももうすぐですね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しでも皆さんにとっての活力になれるよう、私も精一杯ライブにぶつけます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "変化を続けながらも、伝統とらしさを守り続けることは確かでありたい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パフォーマンスに対して誠実に。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そのために私にできることを頑張っている途中です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "観ていて最高だったと思ってもらえるように！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待っていてくださいね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それではまた。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "林瑠奈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きょうの一曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「乃木坂の詩」/ 乃木坂46"}], "source": "official"}